  {
    "id": 2006009010020,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ああ、プロデューサー\r\n奇遇だね",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "bgm": "012",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600901/2006009010020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、そうだな\r\n咲耶は、この時間だと……学校終わりか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006009010030,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ああ、寮へ帰るところさ\r\n外はこの通りで、出歩くのも危ないし──",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600901/2006009010030"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006009010040,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "今日は、暖かいお茶でも飲みながら\r\nのんびりと冬の日を過ごそうと思っているよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "eye_left",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600901/2006009010040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだな、それがいい\r\n転んで怪我でもしたらおおごとだ",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006009010050,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "そうだね、仕事に支障が出たら大変だ",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
